{
    "title": "WordFinder by YourDictionary",
    "description": "<b>Looking for a free word cheater or decoder to help you in Scrabble Go? Do you need a board scan to find the best words to play in Words With Friends?</b> Do you want an anagram finder for Wordscapes, Wordfeud or Word Chums, or improve your Wordle statistics? Are you stuck in any crossword puzzle title like CodyCross? This anagram solver app is for you. It is full of clues and tips!\r\n\r\n<h1>The best free cheater & solver to help you in Words With Friends, Scrabble, Wordle & more</h1>\r\nWordFinder by YourDictionary is a <b>word helper and solver to unscramble jumbled words</b> and find the best word for given rack letters or the right answers for a crossword puzzle. This is the ultimate cheat sheet: Making words and getting help for word connect games and crosswords has never been so easy. WordFinder by YourDictionary is an anagram finder that allows you to use wildcards and gives relevant tips and results for word games (word connect, crosswords, level games...). WordFinder also offers you a way to scan a screenshot of your Words With Friends or Scrabble Go match and it immediately shows you the best words to play on the board.\r\n\r\nOur dictionaries are updated regularly to make sure we have all the words included in each game. Our Words with Friends dictionary solver is the most accurate word list available anywhere! Furthermore, by tapping on any descrambled word, you will look up its definition, so you will score the most points and learn new words every time you need help to play.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for a solver or cheater to unscramble letters and find the right word to solve your board, WordFinder by YourDictionary is the right solution for you to beat your friends:\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Quickly search and find all the possible words appropriate for your game's lexical dictionary: Words With Friends, Scrabble in US or UK, Word Chums, PictoWord, Word Crossy or Word Domination and more word puzzle titles.\r\n\u25b6 You can unscramble words from a generalist dictionary without being tied to any game with the Other Game option.\r\n\u25b6 For Words With Friends and Scrabble Go players, scan your boards from a screenshot and immediately get the best words to play and their placements.\r\n\u25b6 Use our advanced search to find words that start, end, or contain a certain letter or letters already on your game board. The perfect words generator and anagram solver.\r\n\u25b6 For Wordscapes you can directly enter the level to find the solutions and the bonus words!\r\n\u25b6 On our Wordle Solver you can enter the included and excluded letters to find the hidden 5-letter word. Also get hints to solve the NY Times daily puzzle.\r\n\u25b6 Try our Crossword Helper where you can define the length and the already known letters of the word you are looking for.\r\n\u25b6 Get all words for the NY Times Spelling Bee daily puzzle.\r\n\u25b6 Find meanings and related words. Save interesting or high-scoring words that you can check anytime.\r\n\u25b6 Free app with ads. Ad-free options available.\r\n\r\nWordFinder supports all of the 2024 most popular word games with custom lists and point systems:\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Epic games like Words With Friends, Scrabble, Wordscapes, Wordle and Zen Word\r\n\u25b6 Fun titles like Word Wars, Words of Wonders, Word Chums, Wordfeud, Word Connect, Word Cookies, Word Domination, Just Jumble, HQ or Words Story\r\n\u25b6 Crossword games like CodyCross and NY Times Crossword\r\n\r\nIs that blank tile burning a hole in your rack? Use up to three wildcards to find the perfect word to play. Simply include a \u201c?\u201d in your search. We will unscramble the jumbled words and represent the wildcard letter in a different color to help you beat your friends in any word game.\r\n\r\nFound a missing word or need help to report an invalid one? Send it in! We have updated dictionaries for all of the popular games.\r\n\r\nDownload free WordFinder for Android, the best <b>word games cheater</b> and helper to unscramble in 2024.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Looking for a free word cheater or decoder to help you in Scrabble Go? Do you need a board scan to find the best words to play in Words With Friends?</b> Do you want an anagram finder for Wordscapes, Wordfeud or Word Chums, or improve your Wordle statistics? Are you stuck in any crossword puzzle title like CodyCross? This anagram solver app is for you. It is full of clues and tips!<br><br><h1>The best free cheater &amp; solver to help you in Words With Friends, Scrabble, Wordle &amp; more</h1><br>WordFinder by YourDictionary is a <b>word helper and solver to unscramble jumbled words</b> and find the best word for given rack letters or the right answers for a crossword puzzle. This is the ultimate cheat sheet: Making words and getting help for word connect games and crosswords has never been so easy. WordFinder by YourDictionary is an anagram finder that allows you to use wildcards and gives relevant tips and results for word games (word connect, crosswords, level games...). WordFinder also offers you a way to scan a screenshot of your Words With Friends or Scrabble Go match and it immediately shows you the best words to play on the board.<br><br>Our dictionaries are updated regularly to make sure we have all the words included in each game. Our Words with Friends dictionary solver is the most accurate word list available anywhere! Furthermore, by tapping on any descrambled word, you will look up its definition, so you will score the most points and learn new words every time you need help to play.<br><br>If you are looking for a solver or cheater to unscramble letters and find the right word to solve your board, WordFinder by YourDictionary is the right solution for you to beat your friends:<br><br>\u25b6 Quickly search and find all the possible words appropriate for your game&#39;s lexical dictionary: Words With Friends, Scrabble in US or UK, Word Chums, PictoWord, Word Crossy or Word Domination and more word puzzle titles.<br>\u25b6 You can unscramble words from a generalist dictionary without being tied to any game with the Other Game option.<br>\u25b6 For Words With Friends and Scrabble Go players, scan your boards from a screenshot and immediately get the best words to play and their placements.<br>\u25b6 Use our advanced search to find words that start, end, or contain a certain letter or letters already on your game board. The perfect words generator and anagram solver.<br>\u25b6 For Wordscapes you can directly enter the level to find the solutions and the bonus words!<br>\u25b6 On our Wordle Solver you can enter the included and excluded letters to find the hidden 5-letter word. Also get hints to solve the NY Times daily puzzle.<br>\u25b6 Try our Crossword Helper where you can define the length and the already known letters of the word you are looking for.<br>\u25b6 Get all words for the NY Times Spelling Bee daily puzzle.<br>\u25b6 Find meanings and related words. Save interesting or high-scoring words that you can check anytime.<br>\u25b6 Free app with ads. Ad-free options available.<br><br>WordFinder supports all of the 2024 most popular word games with custom lists and point systems:<br><br>\u25b6 Epic games like Words With Friends, Scrabble, Wordscapes, Wordle and Zen Word<br>\u25b6 Fun titles like Word Wars, Words of Wonders, Word Chums, Wordfeud, Word Connect, Word Cookies, Word Domination, Just Jumble, HQ or Words Story<br>\u25b6 Crossword games like CodyCross and NY Times Crossword<br><br>Is that blank tile burning a hole in your rack? Use up to three wildcards to find the perfect word to play. Simply include a \u201c?\u201d in your search. We will unscramble the jumbled words and represent the wildcard letter in a different color to help you beat your friends in any word game.<br><br>Found a missing word or need help to report an invalid one? Send it in! We have updated dictionaries for all of the popular games.<br><br>Download free WordFinder for Android, the best <b>word games cheater</b> and helper to unscramble in 2024.",
